-- Tag CardTrader expansion bins with pokemontcg.io / TCGDex official set ids.
-- pokeapi.co has no TCG sets. pokemontcg.io /v2/sets was 502; used GitHub pokemon-tcg-data (174 EN) + TCGDex.
begin;
